### RE:OWN 리셀 거래 상태 관리 테스트
### transactionId는 낙찰/즉시구매/자동마감 후 생성된 ID로 바꿔서 실행하세요.

### 1. 거래 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resells/transactions/1

### 2. 구매자 결제 완료 처리
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/resells/transactions/1/pay?buyerId=23

### 3. 셀러 배송 준비 처리
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/resells/transactions/1/prepare-shipment?sellerId=1

### 4. 셀러 배송 중 처리
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/resells/transactions/1/ship?sellerId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courierName": "CJ대한통운",
  "trackingNumber": "123456789012"
}

### 5. 구매자 구매 확정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/resells/transactions/1/confirm?buyerId=23

### 6. 셀러 정산 완료
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/resells/transactions/1/settle?sellerId=1

### 7. 거래 취소 테스트
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/resells/transactions/1/cancel?actorId=23
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "테스트 취소"
}
